      "versionNonce": 101881093,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788593965191,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "sort rules by SEQUENCE\ncategories = {}          # running totals\nfor rule in rules:\n   FIXED      \u2192 amount = rule.amount\n   PERCENTAGE \u2192 amount = % \u00d7 base(cat)\n   FORMULA    \u2192 safe-eval(expr, ctx)\n   line = {code, category, amount}\n   categories[cat] += amount\nNET = GROSS \u2212 DEDUCTION\n\u2192 writes PayslipLine per rule\n  (proves logic is REAL, not hardcoded)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "sort rules by SEQUENCE\ncategories = {}          # running totals\nfor rule in rules:\n   FIXED      \u2192 amount = rule.amount\n   PERCENTAGE \u2192 amount = % \u00d7 base(cat)\n   FORMULA    \u2192 safe-eval(expr, ctx)\n   line = {code, category, amount}\n   categories[cat] += amount\nNET = GROSS \u2212 DEDUCTION\n\u2192 writes PayslipLine per rule\n  (proves logic is REAL, not hardcoded)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
